 R←Test_Compose_08(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;cp;parms;rc;msg;text;smiley;subject;from;addr
⍝ Any Unicode character, including those above ⎕UCS 65535, in names, Organization, Subject and Body
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 smiley←⎕UCS 128512
 cp←∆OfflineParms
 cp.Org←'Łódź Software ',smiley
 cp.ReplyTo←'Łukasz Nowak <reply@example.com>'
 subject←'Greetings from Łódź ',smiley,' ⍵ Ωμέγα Привет 你好'
 parms←∆NewMail subject
 parms.From←'Łukasz Nowak <lukasz@example.com>'
 parms.To←'Ωμέγα <omega@example.com>'
 parms.Body←('Hello ',smiley)('Привет 你好 ',smiley)
 (rc msg text)←cp ∆Compose parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf∧/78≥≢¨∆HeaderLines text
 →T.PassesIf∧/127≥⎕UCS∊∆HeaderLines text
 →T.PassesIf subject≡∆DecodeWords text ∆Header'Subject'
 →T.PassesIf cp.Org≡∆DecodeWords text ∆Header'Organization'
 from←text ∆Header'From'
 addr←' <lukasz@example.com>'
 →T.PassesIf addr≡(-≢addr)↑from
 →T.PassesIf'Łukasz Nowak'≡∆DecodeWords(-≢addr)↓from
 →T.PassesIf'Łukasz Nowak'≡∆DecodeWords{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'<'}text ∆Header'Reply-To'
 →T.PassesIf'Ωμέγα'≡∆DecodeWords{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'<'}text ∆Header'To'
 →T.PassesIf∧/parms.Body∊{'UTF-8'⎕UCS ⎕UCS ⍵}¨SMTP.Message.SplitLines text

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
